        "value": "藩制一覧表 第八冊（花房）— 版心右端の柱（走り頭）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Running page-header in the right margin: Domain Survey Table, eighth fascicle (Hanabusa). The nine 藩制一覧表 fascicles are numbered registers, not thematic tables; fascicles 8-9 hold the officials and military rosters. Provenance only, not domain data."
